stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> READY : Process Created & Enqueued (Flight Scheduled)
    
    READY --> RUNNING : Scheduler Dispatches Process (Runway Free & Allocated)
    READY --> READY : Priority Aging Applied (Increment Effective Priority)
    READY --> READY : Emergency Declared (Escalate to Priority 5)
    
    RUNNING --> BLOCKED : Runway Temporarily Blocked / Weather Hold
    BLOCKED --> READY : Resource Cleared / Re-enqueued in ReadyQueue
    
    RUNNING --> COMPLETED : Flight Finishes Landing/Takeoff (Runway Released & Transaction Committed)
    
    COMPLETED --> [*] : Metrics Recorded (Turnaround & Waiting Times Finalized)
